Dear Neo,

I hope you and the team at Lekker Bakes are well.

Welcome to the October 2026 edition of the Highveld Savings customer newsletter. Thank you for banking with us.

Product news this month is our new Savings Pockets feature. You can now set aside funds for different goals within your existing account and track progress in our mobile app. There are no fees to create a pocket, and you can add or withdraw at any time.

Our seasonal tip for spring is to review your monthly expenses and set a small savings goal before the festive season arrives. Even putting aside a fixed amount each week can make a difference.

